      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59297b30cba6f2da259f9b1f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是我樱花进王呢！可是称霸了\n1200米×3的长距离无数次的赛马娘呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04a48a6abc0c66c7c6538fcadb5c81564ba401ec2517bff096ba83a6b8ad7771",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b21823829485a29697da3d7b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就我所知，\n樱花进王是短距离的专家。\n至今已经在各个短距离GⅠ跑出过好成绩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "891fe685969782718c353aecac5609db3a40f8cb1e26748c8cbf55c444186278",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddd5852329d9cd26ed851570",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而我却从没听过1200米×3=3600米\n=长距离这种说法。\n感觉是她用自己独特的世界观做出的结论……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3da69fb5eb14f2127c7e0284086cca1898c8d30846e24d5ea3e4b0b4750e4b9b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1068/storytimeline_501068119.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fdf8697b8141ce143a6cafca",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不行，这只是你误以为没事而已……",
      "source_fingerprint": "41745cec2ab4a55f95f189ebb77e58f7e8b3ca3bd6c925ed552a5c7c77fc1ed9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
