    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb8fc1f92dcebdfd3b1bf1df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "眼看北部玄驹差点就要相信，\n我简短地出声阻止，并开始思考。",
