      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，\n训练员最后还是决定不让我参加德比呢。\n本来以为训练员会要我参加的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "dbce7ee7fa73df6e3634b9e37468a899a7fbc27747882230d38b2afb4a48e2ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
